 "KRW", "description": "Atomas is back with a fresh take and a bunch of new gameplay mechanics.\n\nEasy to learn but full of depth, it’s the perfect game for passing time on your commute, while waiting in line, or whenever you have a few minutes to spare.\n\nStart with hydrogen and fuse atoms together as you work your way up to the final and mythical element, Omnium, said by neo alchemists to have the power to create any molecule ever imagined.\n\nAs you play, you unlock and equip up to three tools by reaching new high scores. Use them to get out of tricky situations or to set up smarter, more strategic moves.\n\nAs you progress through the elements, you enter atomic realms where you can choose between three permanent effects that stay with you for the rest of your run, and with the right combination, your score can grow exponentially.\n\nNew special atoms like the Swapper, Amplifier and the Glitch add more variety and open up new strategic possibilities.\n\nMolecular chains act as score multipliers, letting you push your score higher and higher. With all these systems working together, every run feels different and offers a fresh challenge.\n\nBecome a neo-alchemist and create the legendary element Omnium.", "minimumOsVersion": "15.0", "releaseDate": "2026-05-13T07:00:00Z", "userRatingCount": 1}]}